id: supporting-defender
name: Supporting Defender
talentCategory: teamwork
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  Able to create openings in your opponents’ attacks, you provide perfect defensive support for your allies.
text: >
  Supporting Defender: Able to create openings in your opponents’ attacks, you provide perfect defensive support for your allies.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  (1)-[Passive]: If you are on a Square adjacent to an Opponent, increase all of your Allies’ Dodge Rolls, or Strike Rolls when using the Parry effect of the Defend Maneuver, made against that Opponent by 1(T).

---

[passive]
# (1) An Ally's Dodge, or Parry's Strike, against the attack of an Opponent you - not Defeated - are on a Square adjacent to:
# 1(T), your Tier; one Supporting Defender at a time, the highest (chat.mjs supportParts).
allow supporting.defender;
